[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=UDP Census v1.0\\\\4-Series. UdpCensus_v1.clz must sit in this folder.
  Cmn2=||1SPlusCC does not\\rebuild that library.\\\\This socket defaults||1
  Cmn3=to UDP 50002.\\\\SIMPL+ names are case-insensitive. A local with||1
  Cmn4=the same name as an input\\is that input. String outputs are write-
  Cmn5=only. Keep a copy, compare it,\\and assign the output only when||1
  Cmn6=the text changes. Digitals and Count can\\be read.\\\\Show_Index||1
  Cmn7=0 is row 1 until the analog moves. After that, 0 blanks the\\four||1
  Cmn8=Processor outputs and drops Answered_FB. Count does not change.\\
  Cmn9=\\Notices, and only these, go to the error log:\\  UdpCensus: answered||1
  Cmn10=<ip>:<port>\\  UdpCensus: added <uid> <ip>\\  UdpCensus: removed||1
  Cmn11=<uid> <ip>\\GenerateUserNotice needs a format string: GenerateUserNotice("%s",||1
  Cmn12=NoticeBuf).\\\\A non-zero Poll_Interval below 1s is raised to 1s.
  Cmn13=||1Poll_Window 0 becomes 3s.\\The window is clamped to 0.5s-30s. A||1
  Cmn14=port outside 1024-65535 becomes 50002.\\\\Press F1 for UDP Census||1
  Cmn15=v1.0.html. Leave that file next to this module.\\\\-- VERSION HISTORY||1
  Cmn16=--\\v1.0  2026-10-20\\- 2026-11-03: UDP_Port default is 50002. An||1
  Cmn17=out-of-range port becomes 50002\\- 2026-11-03: F1 opens UDP Census||1
  Cmn18=v1.0.html\\- 2026-11-03: Show_Index shares the Count row. A blank||1
  Cmn19=row sits above Processor_IP\\- Poll, answer, or both, in one symbol\\
  Cmn20=- Indexed database of the processors that answered\\- 2026-11-02||1
  Cmn21=Symbol rows: blank around Enable, Discover above Respond, poll times||1
  Cmn22=together\\- Count and the database strings were ignored because||1
  Cmn23=the callback names matched the signals\\- A discover poll is sent||1
  Cmn24=on the Poll path as soon as the socket is open\\- The row selector||1
  Cmn25=is Show_Index. 1 displays the first row\\- Answering a poll posts||1
  Cmn26=a user notice. A row is noted only when it is added or removed\\
  Cmn27=- An output is written only when its value changes\\
[END]
